name vectorlogos
category Package
revision 69010
shortdesc Vectorial logos (GeoGebra, Emacs, Scratch, ...) with 'inline' support
relocated 1
longdesc With this package you can insert vectorial logos of some
longdesc 'classic' software. The format of the logos is pdf. The package
longdesc provides macros to insert them inline, with automatic height
longdesc and alignment.
runfiles size=32
 RELOC/tex/latex/vectorlogos/vectorlogo-emacs-alt.pdf
 RELOC/tex/latex/vectorlogos/vectorlogo-emacs.pdf
 RELOC/tex/latex/vectorlogos/vectorlogo-geogebra-icon.pdf
